                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2499e5fd-9fdd-41fb-94d5-2fc24e0f4280",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f370785-e876-3551-bea9-aa757a38e301",
                        "source_sense_id": "52ea0100-f71a-3f63-b170-1c4fc3b5370e",
                        "target_lang_word": "ignominious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ignominious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                        "entry_id": "9b84596d-6c02-3557-be36-14bf03c57b91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marked by great disgrace, dishonour, humiliation, or shame; disgraceful, shameful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b682810e-a4bf-4984-b4c1-04a3fd818067",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "The time when the pseudovirtuous men and women die a painful and ignominious death has yet to come."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75e7d6a9-9a71-48a0-96f3-ec0984380b17",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "Hath he not tvvit our Soueraigne Lady here / VVith ignominious vvords, though Clarkely coucht? / As if ſhe had ſuborned ſome to ſvveare / Falſe allegations, to o'rethrovv his ſtate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a5a175f-8a88-449b-a749-bd2f473b82f6",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "The golden eagle, which glittered in the front of the legion, was the object of their fondest devotion; nor was it esteemed less impious than it was ignominious, to abandon that sacred ensign in the hour of danger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be7a4890-ecae-4228-92a9-349fa0f8ff02",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "And it came to pass that they took him; and his name was Nehor; and they carried him upon the top of the hill Manti, and there he was caused, or rather did acknowledge, between the heavens and the earth, that what he had taught to the people was contrary to the word of God; and there he suffered an ignominious death."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff40552e-b0a9-4eb6-aae6-843fe3975e45",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "[T]he façade of the cathedral did not stand ignominious in faded stucco, but had upon it the magnificent promise of the half-completed marble inlaying and statued niches, which Giotto had devised a hundred and fifty years before; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b38834cf-93dd-456e-8a0c-fbf470faa35b",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "Greene died of a debauch; and Marlowe, the gracer of tragedians, perished in an ignominious brawl."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3bec9d0-a272-497a-a92c-620fba6519a8",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "In sheer malignity, thinking to set back our plans and avenge himself for his ignominious expulsion, this traitor has crept here under cover of night and destroyed our work of nearly a year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ac0cd59-f7fe-4026-85b1-a79c6255e59d",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "For Roy Hodgson it was a desperate and ignominious way to end his four years as England manager. Whatever else happened in that time, his period in office will probably always be remembered for the full-on humiliation that accompanied this defeat and the knowledge it will rank among the more infamous results in the history of the national team."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ecf63b2-7b01-4f98-bc78-b2e4cad9e739",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "And yet it also seems that Khashoggi avoided anything as ignominious as personal bankruptcy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2693e666-d7f2-4848-9e45-e8de8f4244fa",
                                                "sense_id": "82620953-e0b6-32fa-a125-01e270e2958b",
                                                "text": "“Oh, what in the Sam Hill are you a-wearing? I thought I was supposed to be Twain.” “I say you are incorrect, sir. I believe we decided I would be Twain.” “Twin Twains? That dog won't hunt.” “Uh, Mr. Clemens?” “Mmhmm. That's me.” “No, I'm Twain. Switch costumes, you ignominious pretender.” “You're more stubborn than a senate mule.” “Grits, grits, grits!” “Tarnation!” “Fancy pants, big-city lawyer.” “I say you are incorrect, sir.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5bba2933-0c0c-4b18-a0c5-f55e3c963c85",
                        "source_entry_id": "3f370785-e876-3551-bea9-aa757a38e301",
                        "source_sense_id": "52ea0100-f71a-3f63-b170-1c4fc3b5370e",
                        "target_lang_word": "ignominieux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ignominieux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                        "entry_id": "18c8abb4-da3d-3a91-9f48-0ba4f6ba2099",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui cause de l’ignominie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d6f8f1f-1ca3-4a2d-b143-fb31f57db489",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "Mort ignominieuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "875a71ee-9756-44ed-8c80-9515dbf8b6d6",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "Supplice ignominieux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6544dc5a-bcc8-48e6-abd1-73f761507157",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "Des six courses qu’il m’a été donné jusqu’à présent de voir, la première aux arènes romaines de Fréjus, était purement ignominieuse : des toreros ou trop jeunes ou trop vieux ; de grands veaux massacrés pire qu’à la boucherie, parfois urinant de frayeur ou beuglant ; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02e62434-cac0-42b8-97b2-3d13cd0b30b2",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "Je pus rejoindre mon guide : il s’était arrêté un peu plus loin, le dos au mur, et il écoutait en connaisseur les imputations déshonorantes et les ignominieux conseils que prodiguait la voix de l’innocence enragée. J’étais moi-même émerveillé par la richesse du langage secondaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9f72c43-e2e0-4405-8deb-e03199e60581",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "J’avançais comme en glissant, me rapprochant sans cesse du lieu interdit. Certes, c’était pitoyable, j’en convenais, c’était même ignominieux, vraiment ignominieux ; mais rien n’y faisait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04acdd76-0df0-4468-af42-2a298ee20292",
                                                "sense_id": "a765bba6-6908-3e65-978c-1950770f3e1b",
                                                "text": "– Ta rage contre toi-même… c’était au lycée Fénelon… quand pour la première fois Monsieur Georgin, en rendant les versions latines, t’a dit : « Mais que s’est-il passé ? Vous êtes… » était-ce troisième ou seconde ?...\n– Sur le chemin du retour, j’ai sorti de mon cartable l’ignominieuse copie, je l’ai piétinée, je l’ai déchirée, et j’ai jeté ses morceaux dans le bassin de la place Médicis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
